  "description": "Ring B caching for the Goldpath enterprise asset: Microsoft HybridCache (L1+L2, stampede-protected, tag invalidation) as the app surface and Mediant [Cacheable]/[InvalidatesCache] as the query surface — composed, not wrapped. Goldpath adds the manifest-driven L1/L2 wiring and the tenant-scoped key convention (goldpath:{tenant}:{area}:{key}).",
